    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_194_leto_1#9$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, uh... say, I still don't know your name.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Aren't you guys pretty particular about uh, introducing yourselves when you first meet?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "An oversight on my part.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "text": "You may call me John Smith. Or anything you prefer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_194_leto_1#13$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "John...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "text": "The name John Smith...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you think of it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'John Smith'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_194_leto_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sounds... right out of a spy movie I watched with the Doctor!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, that was definitely the name of the spy guy!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "text": "I remember he had a really pretty sidekick too, so John, you... Never mind, coming up to this make-out point all alone means you're definitely single.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'John Smith'"
    },
    {
        "text": "A fascinating coincidence.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'John Smith'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_194_leto_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, let's get back on track. I figure we still have a while to go before the summit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "text": "I heard it gets colder the higher you go, and it gets harder to breathe too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_194_leto_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, you tired yet? Need a break?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please, don't worry about me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'John Smith'"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you need to rest, Madam Larina?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'John Smith'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_194_leto_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nah, I'm good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_194_leto_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've got some real stamina, huh, Mr. Spy?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Haha.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'John Smith'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
