    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Seems like you really deceived him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1#2$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charactercutin",
        "widgetID": 1,
        "name": "avg_172_svrash_1#2$1",
        "style": "cutin",
        "fadestyle": "horiz_expand_center",
        "fadetime": 0,
        "offsetx": 350,
        "width": 300,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "I fabricated no lies, Degenbrecher.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charactercutin",
        "widgetID": 1,
        "name": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1",
        "style": "cutin",
        "fadestyle": "horiz_expand_center",
        "fadetime": 0,
        "offsetx": 350,
        "width": 300,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "There's no slipping your average falsehoods by a Trilby Asher collecting information for his Duke.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I'm fully aware that these types usually know 'suspicion' best.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "text": "'The heir to the Paleroche Clan has secretly returned to the country' is a reality he first discovered by himself, so he'll believe it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "text": "And will definitely be watching Rosalind Tatyanovna Larina.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your guesses are always right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "text": "The girl's already on the mountain, and Ratatos has contacted Arctosz.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I hear tell the Trilby Asher is also on his way up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "He's hiding from me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1#1$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charactercutin",
        "widgetID": 1,
        "name": "avg_172_svrash_1#2$1",
        "style": "cutin",
        "fadestyle": "horiz_expand_center",
        "fadetime": 0,
        "offsetx": 350,
        "width": 300,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "No matter.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charactercutin",
        "widgetID": 1,
        "name": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1",
        "style": "cutin",
        "fadestyle": "horiz_expand_center",
        "fadetime": 0,
        "offsetx": 350,
        "width": 300,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Just make sure he remains focused on the girl.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's time for you to move as well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fine, I'll treat it as after-meal exercise.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "However, are you sure the Doctor won't mind you letting the Trilby Asher close to the girl?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1#1$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charactercutin",
        "widgetID": 1,
        "name": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1",
        "style": "cutin",
        "fadestyle": "horiz_expand_center",
        "fadetime": 0,
        "offsetx": 350,
        "width": 300,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "He's a spy, not an assassin. What he's after is information, not a life.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that how you plan to explain it to the Doctor?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1#10$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charactercutin",
        "widgetID": 1,
        "name": "avg_172_svrash_1#2$1",
        "style": "cutin",
        "fadestyle": "horiz_expand_center",
        "fadetime": 0,
        "offsetx": 350,
        "width": 300,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "To the Doctor, I shall offer my\u2014apologies.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You certainly owe them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charactercutin",
        "widgetID": 1,
        "name": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1",
        "style": "cutin",
        "fadestyle": "horiz_expand_center",
        "fadetime": 0,
        "offsetx": 350,
        "width": 300,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1#1$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "text": "How I act is unimportant. Rather, I'm more curious\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "text": "Degenbrecher, you remember the Doctor?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sharp's a good opponent. Stronger than most of those clumsy knights.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's no harm in noting down someone who has the respect of a warrior like that and can also make you suffer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1#9$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charactercutin",
        "widgetID": 1,
        "name": "avg_172_svrash_1#4$1",
        "style": "cutin",
        "fadestyle": "horiz_expand_center",
        "fadetime": 0,
        "offsetx": 350,
        "width": 300,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "You're curious about the Doctor?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You could put it that way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, the idle chatter stops here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm going to work.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$transmission"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charactercutin",
        "widgetID": 1,
        "block": false
    },
