    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_snowrun",
        "channel": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_194_leto_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "URA\u2014!!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're finally here\u2014\u2014!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_194_leto_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hoo. We must have climbed a few hours?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm beat. No wonder everyone quits halfway. That was exhausting.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Though...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_194_leto_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The view up here is really pretty... isn't that Lake Silberneherze over there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_194_leto_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hahaha, the Kjeragandr statue looks smaller than my thumb from up here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_snowbootwalk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Lake Silberneherze freezes over in the winter, and resembles a pure and clear gemstone when viewed from this peak.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'John Smith'"
    },
    {
        "text": "As such, the locals here believe the lake is a precious stone bestowed by Kjeragandr.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'John Smith'"
    },
    {
        "text": "Truly a view you can only see from such a height.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'John Smith'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_194_leto_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It does look like a gem.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, you can even see the station over there!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh, there's actually plenty of railroads in Kjerag, but the trains all look like toys from here...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I wouldn't call this plenty for a country that's still developing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'John Smith'"
    },
    {
        "text": "It might seem like a lot, but that's because Lake Silberneherze and the Kjeragandr statue are here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'John Smith'"
    },
    {
        "text": "There might be more roads around Karlan currently, but the operating lines will all pass through and transfer here...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'John Smith'"
    },
    {
        "text": "...They will, won't they...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'John Smith'"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'John Smith'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_194_leto_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, John, you still with us? I need a favor?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Can you help me see if there are two trees growing into each other around here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_194_leto_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "They should be old, with intertwining branches, and they look pretty strange too!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It would be my pleasure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'John Smith'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_194_leto_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Appreciate it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_snowrun",
        "channel": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You know, John.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Aren't you curious why I'm looking for those trees?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Or what I'm doing up here on the mountain?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "text": "I mulled it over... and decided to handle things the old fashioned way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'John Smith'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_194_leto_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Fess up, and don't move!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_cnstrctnck"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 20,
        "ystrength": 20,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$nervous_intro",
        "key": "$nervous_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "What is the meaning of this, Madam Larina?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'John Smith'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_194_leto_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're not supposed to say that line yet, I haven't even done anything to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Spit it out though. You've been following me for ages, just following. What are you after here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't understand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'John Smith'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_194_leto_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Quit playing dumb!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't remember telling you my name.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is a misunderstanding.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'John Smith'"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know the Viscount Harold Craigavon and I have history together, and it was he who told me your name.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'John Smith'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_194_leto_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clnchfst"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_194_leto_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You think I'm stupid?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "text": "I never told him my full name either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "text": "And you managed to climb up the summit without taking a single break. There's no way you could have fallen into a simple hunter's trap!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if you did, you could have just climbed out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Anna and the girls always tell me to think before I act, but I have to say, sometimes there's no use in thinking too much either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'John Smith'"
    },
    {
        "text": "You are much more careful than I expected, Madam Larina.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'John Smith'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_194_leto_1#13$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So you admit it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "text": "John Smith is probably a fake name too, right? Maybe... you really <i>are</i> a spy?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What if I said yes?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_194_leto_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then you'd be pretty bad at your job.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_194_leto_1#13$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Cause even I could tell something was up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your accusation is absolutely correct.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's true. I have been quite careless, and life in Kjerag has made me so.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have considerable freedom here, and there aren't many who pose a threat to me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_194_leto_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah, look at you talk.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm warning you, you'd better behave. And don't move an inch.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're standing on the edge of a cliff, and there's nothing but snow under your feet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "text": "I just have to stomp my feet to send you falling, and I can't promise I'll catch you if that happens.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, Madam Larina. I'll come clean, yesterday...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 20,
        "ystrength": 20,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Victorian scum!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arctosz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_snowrun",
        "channel": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_254_1#8$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1.5,
        "xstrength": 20,
        "ystrength": 20,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Arctosz is here! You stay away from her!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arctosz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_194_leto_1#14$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whoa! Wh-Where did you come from?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah-ah-ah-ah, wait! Watch your footfalls, the snow\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_snowbodyfall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 40,
        "ystrength": 40,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "0,-20",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0,
        "duration": 0.3
    },
    {
        "text": "Wahh\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_254_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "R-Rosalind!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arctosz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_254_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Grab my\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arctosz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's somewhat funny, but Arctosz is clearly charging towards me\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "text": "Could Rosalind really have come here for something?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "text": "No matter. He's coming, and I can only jump.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
