    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1#6$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...The Black Knight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "All rested up?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's not good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "text": "You'll be less fun to fight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Going straight into it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Problem with that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll get straight to my point too then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "text": "You convinced the Viscount that everything on the train was a misunderstanding. I was only half-convinced at the time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "text": "But now, I know that even the stately Black Knight tells lies.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That only proves that you don't know me at all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's still time to turn around and go down the mountain for a nice lunch.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sorry, but I tend to throw myself fully into my work.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
